{5} \\mathrm{~Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、密度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1.2 \\mathrm{~kg} / \\mathrm{m}^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，假设热气球膨胀过程中内部气体压强不变，不计热气球弹性薄膜的质量和重物受到的浮力。求：\n（1）热气球内部空气升温至 "},{"type":"math","value":"69^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，空气的体积；\n（2）热气球内部空气从 "},{"type":"math","value":"12^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":" 升温至 "},{"type":"math","value":"69^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":" 过程中，空气内能的增加量；\n(3) 重物的质量 m。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/09571f843a63495eadc7e4528313d7d613553aeb7a37db353ec11573719782ab.png","width":190,"height":248,"width_mm":22.266,"row_group":"shaoxing-zhenduan-2511-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第15题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（1）等压过程"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_0}{T_0} = \\frac{V_1}{T_1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"V_1=\\frac{T_1}{T_0}V_0=1.2\\times10^3\\ \\mathrm{m}^3"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"W = -p_{0}(V_{1} - V_{0}) = -2 \\times 10^{7} \\mathrm{~J}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q_{1} = 5\\times 10^{7}\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"mg=\\rho g\\ (V_{1}-V_{0})"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n得 m=240kg (1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--shaoxing-zhenduan-2511-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--shaoxing-zhenduan-2511","source_question_id":"shaoxing-zhenduan-2511-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3c70cfade5758c5dd5d95ec3f61ca44db351cf35b4bf9ab9015ad298ba2e144e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）某兴趣小组设计了一弹射抛接轨道，其竖直截面如图所示，下水平面上的弹簧左端固定连接，右端被锁定于 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，紧靠 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点放置一个滑块（可视作质点），光滑轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"OA"},{"type":"text","value":" 与倾角 "},{"type":"math","value":"37^{\\circ}"},{"t